## 🛠️ Core Capabilities

| Command | Description | Access |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `!ping` | Checks WebSocket latency and uptime | Everyone |
| `!echo <text>` | Repeats input text with human-paced typing delay | Everyone |
| `!antilink` | Toggles automatic link deletion in group chats | Group Admins |
| `!help` | Displays interactive command menu | Everyone |

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/yourusername/prime-wa-bot.git](https://github.com/yourusername/prime-wa-bot.git)
cd prime-wa-bot

# 2. Install dependencies
npm install

# 3. Start the bot and scan the terminal QR code
node index.js